            "q": "How do I calculate how many weeks pregnant I am?",
            "a": "Count the number of full weeks from the first day of your last menstrual period to today; that number is your current week. If your last period started 8 weeks ago, you are 8 weeks pregnant. You can also subtract the weeks remaining until your due date from 40. If you are unsure of your dates, an early ultrasound can establish them."
